1
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:18,260
♪If I am gone from this world,
will the dark night collapse?♪

2
00:00:18,880 --> 00:00:25,820
♪If I never return
to guard by your side♪

3
00:00:26,270 --> 00:00:30,800
♪If I seal away our encounter
and erase all trace♪

4
00:00:31,010 --> 00:00:33,900
♪Like endless snow
falling into the deep sea♪

5
00:00:33,972 --> 00:00:40,272
♪This life is but a fleeting illusion,
yet it gave me courage♪

6
00:00:40,510 --> 00:00:41,740
♪Love is a miracle♪

7
00:00:41,740 --> 00:00:42,920
=Spring Over Phoenix Pond=

8
00:00:42,920 --> 00:00:45,300
(Adapted from Qin An'an's
"Spring Over Phoenix Pond")

9
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:48,260
=Episode 11=

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:49,720
(Marquis Yongping Residence)

11
00:00:49,750 --> 00:00:50,320
Your Highness,

12
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:52,430
Her Highness's death
has yet to be investigated.

13
00:00:52,430 --> 00:00:54,000
She died in your manor,

14
00:00:54,050 --> 00:00:56,070
and the poison was found
in your daughter's room.

15
00:00:56,320 --> 00:00:57,330
Can you bear that charge,

16
00:00:57,840 --> 00:00:58,840
Marquis?

17
00:00:59,150 --> 00:00:59,560
I...

18
00:01:00,500 --> 00:01:01,990
I beg you to judge wisely, Your Highness.

19
00:01:02,150 --> 00:01:02,990
We knew nothing about

20
00:01:03,070 --> 00:01:04,280
that poison.

21
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:04,680
Exactly.

22
00:01:04,950 --> 00:01:06,150
Since it was found in her room,

23
00:01:06,150 --> 00:01:07,640
just take her away.

24
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:09,270
I haven't settled the score with you

25
00:01:09,280 --> 00:01:10,870
over the ledger.

26
00:01:11,150 --> 00:01:12,280
Taking only her today

27
00:01:12,350 --> 00:01:13,920
and sparing the rest of your family

28
00:01:14,350 --> 00:01:15,560
is mercy enough.

29
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:16,430
Fine.

30
00:01:16,560 --> 00:01:17,350
Take her away.

31
00:01:18,590 --> 00:01:19,430
Your consort...

32
00:01:19,790 --> 00:01:20,480
Marquis,

33
00:01:21,070 --> 00:01:22,510
did you hear that?

34
00:01:23,790 --> 00:01:24,400
Your Highness,

35
00:01:24,430 --> 00:01:26,230
the Young Lady is innocent.

36
00:01:26,230 --> 00:01:27,230
You can't take her.

37
00:01:44,930 --> 00:01:51,390
♪Leaves fall in the cold wind,
a fleeting glance between pavilions♪

38
00:01:52,370 --> 00:01:58,920
♪Still unable to step out of this
devout dream until the end of time♪

39
00:02:00,070 --> 00:02:06,280
♪Love drifts through the whirlpool
of farewell, brushing past me♪

40
00:02:06,310 --> 00:02:07,750
Uncle, you're abducting a noble lady.

41
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:09,560
Aren't you afraid of impeachment?

42
00:02:10,240 --> 00:02:11,470
You came.

43
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,000
Where's the ledger?

44
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:14,560
What ledger?

45
00:02:15,750 --> 00:02:18,280
I heard Aunt met with an accident
at the Qi Residence,

46
00:02:18,500 --> 00:02:20,690
so I invited Official Zhang
from the Ministry of Justice

47
00:02:20,870 --> 00:02:22,190
to investigate.

48
00:02:23,190 --> 00:02:24,520
This is my family matter.

49
00:02:24,710 --> 00:02:26,520
The Ministry of Justice
has no business here.

50
00:02:26,750 --> 00:02:27,750
A murder case

51
00:02:27,750 --> 00:02:28,870
is no family affair.

52
00:02:28,870 --> 00:02:29,910
If your conscience is clear,

53
00:02:29,910 --> 00:02:31,190
why fear an autopsy?

54
00:02:32,310 --> 00:02:33,680
No need to trouble yourself, Uncle.

55
00:02:34,120 --> 00:02:36,190
I've had it done.

56
00:02:37,960 --> 00:02:38,560
Official Zhang,

57
00:02:38,710 --> 00:02:39,400
tell him.

58
00:02:39,800 --> 00:02:40,520
Your Highness,

59
00:02:41,290 --> 00:02:42,870
there was water in the deceased's lungs,

60
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,280
and her fingertips were pale.

61
00:02:44,870 --> 00:02:46,150
She drowned.

62
00:02:46,750 --> 00:02:47,840
Drowned?

63
00:02:49,630 --> 00:02:50,280
Yuan,

64
00:02:50,560 --> 00:02:51,310
what are you doing?

65
00:02:51,310 --> 00:02:52,710
Hurry and find a way
to deal with the body.

66
00:02:52,710 --> 00:02:54,080
Prince Qi is framing us.

67
00:02:54,190 --> 00:02:55,630
We need to beat him at his own game.

68
00:02:59,000 --> 00:02:59,800
Found it.

69
00:03:02,710 --> 00:03:03,630
Bingzhan Grass.

70
00:03:04,030 --> 00:03:04,520
Father,

71
00:03:04,630 --> 00:03:05,750
move her to the hot spring.

72
00:03:05,800 --> 00:03:06,590
Why?

73
00:03:07,630 --> 00:03:08,750
Bingzhan Grass's poison

74
00:03:08,770 --> 00:03:10,790
causes suffocation,
which looks just like drowning.

75
00:03:10,840 --> 00:03:12,360
Pump water into her lungs with a reed,

76
00:03:12,400 --> 00:03:13,690
then leave her in the hot spring.

77
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,800
I'll deal with Prince Qi.

78
00:03:15,360 --> 00:03:16,080
Official Zhang,

79
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,080
isn't your conclusion

80
00:03:18,560 --> 00:03:20,190
rather hasty?

81
00:03:21,240 --> 00:03:22,520
Uncle, if you're not satisfied,

82
00:03:23,080 --> 00:03:24,710
we can always summon another coroner.

83
00:03:24,720 --> 00:03:25,750
Have him examine her again.

84
00:03:26,000 --> 00:03:27,590
Imperial decree.

85
00:03:34,080 --> 00:03:36,030
But His Majesty's command,

86
00:03:36,190 --> 00:03:38,710
Prince Qi is to enter the palace.

87
00:03:41,240 --> 00:03:42,000
Uncle,

88
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:43,800
please.

89
00:04:05,540 --> 00:04:07,060
(Ledger)

90
00:04:10,560 --> 00:04:11,800
The floods in Da'an

91
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,680
left countless people homeless,

92
00:04:14,840 --> 00:04:16,560
yet you dared pocket

93
00:04:16,560 --> 00:04:18,000
the disaster relief funds.

94
00:04:18,310 --> 00:04:18,880
Your Majesty,

95
00:04:19,750 --> 00:04:20,750
I'm innocent!

96
00:04:21,310 --> 00:04:22,510
Can a mere ledger

97
00:04:22,720 --> 00:04:24,390
prove I embezzled the funds?

98
00:04:25,360 --> 00:04:26,630
I refuse to accept it.

99
00:04:27,070 --> 00:04:28,240
The evidence is conclusive.

100
00:04:28,510 --> 00:04:29,830
Are you still denying it?

101
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:37,950
Your Majesty,

102
00:04:38,560 --> 00:04:40,720
I have something to say.

103
00:04:48,210 --> 00:04:49,580
Grand Preceptor Zhou, you're sick.

104
00:04:49,630 --> 00:04:50,680
What brings you here?

105
00:04:51,380 --> 00:04:53,460
(Grand Preceptor Zhou,
tutor to Prince Qi)

106
00:04:53,510 --> 00:04:54,800
I heard His Highness

107
00:04:54,830 --> 00:04:57,270
was accused over the relief funds.

108
00:04:57,630 --> 00:05:00,160
I've come to risk my life
to speak for him.

109
00:05:01,430 --> 00:05:02,920
(Marquis Yongping Residence)
What do you

110
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,870
make of the situation?

111
00:05:06,430 --> 00:05:07,720
The relief effort

112
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:10,270
is His Majesty's top priority.

113
00:05:10,270 --> 00:05:12,920
Now that the ledger
has reached the throne,

114
00:05:13,240 --> 00:05:15,310
Prince Qi will surely be punished.

115
00:05:15,360 --> 00:05:16,480
He'll lose his influence,

116
00:05:16,870 --> 00:05:19,630
while Prince Jing
may regain imperial favor.

117
00:05:19,920 --> 00:05:21,800
The Yongping Marquis Residence

118
00:05:22,070 --> 00:05:24,800
could rise again through him.

119
00:05:27,800 --> 00:05:29,920
But Grand Preceptor Zhou

120
00:05:29,920 --> 00:05:31,600
has served three reigns

121
00:05:32,160 --> 00:05:33,720
and is beyond reproach.

122
00:05:34,070 --> 00:05:36,390
His Majesty trusts him deeply.

123
00:05:36,920 --> 00:05:39,830
If he vouches for Prince Qi,

124
00:05:40,560 --> 00:05:41,870
I'm afraid...

125
00:05:43,000 --> 00:05:44,360
(Grand Preceptor Zhou...)

126
00:05:45,390 --> 00:05:48,070
Such a disgrace in the Qi Residence

127
00:05:48,630 --> 00:05:51,040
speaks volumes about its conduct.

128
00:05:54,000 --> 00:05:55,800
I think the marriage alliance
with Prince Qi

129
00:05:56,480 --> 00:05:57,950
should be called off.

130
00:05:58,510 --> 00:05:59,040
Mother,

131
00:05:59,680 --> 00:06:00,720
stop hesitating.

132
00:06:01,040 --> 00:06:02,100
You can't run Jin's future

133
00:06:02,120 --> 00:06:03,310
because of her.

134
00:06:05,480 --> 00:06:06,000
Guards,

135
00:06:06,480 --> 00:06:07,870
throw her out.

136
00:06:07,920 --> 00:06:08,510
- Yes.
- Yes.

137
00:06:12,830 --> 00:06:13,480
Mother!

138
00:06:14,160 --> 00:06:14,800
Mother!

139
00:06:15,160 --> 00:06:15,800
Brother!

140
00:06:16,480 --> 00:06:17,950
They framed me!

141
00:06:19,120 --> 00:06:20,680
I'm innocent!

142
00:06:21,630 --> 00:06:23,120
I'm innocent!

143
00:06:24,630 --> 00:06:25,270
Yuan.

144
00:06:25,720 --> 00:06:26,270
Yuan.

145
00:06:31,600 --> 00:06:32,480
Grandfather.

146
00:06:32,920 --> 00:06:33,630
Father.

147
00:06:34,310 --> 00:06:36,830
I had planned to proceed gradually.

148
00:06:37,190 --> 00:06:39,040
Cutting off Prince Qi's funding

149
00:06:39,120 --> 00:06:40,120
is enough for now.

150
00:06:46,800 --> 00:06:48,160
The evidence was all there,

151
00:06:48,430 --> 00:06:49,480
yet Prince Qi escaped

152
00:06:49,480 --> 00:06:50,360
thanks to those old wounds

153
00:06:50,360 --> 00:06:51,590
and Grand Preceptor Zhou's defense.

154
00:06:51,600 --> 00:06:54,120
His Majesty believed he'd suffered them
during disaster relief.

155
00:06:54,130 --> 00:06:55,990
The case has now been handed
to the Court of Judicial Review.

156
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:59,240
They're all Prince Qi's men.

157
00:06:59,430 --> 00:07:00,720
The embezzlement case

158
00:07:01,000 --> 00:07:02,560
will be buried.

159
00:07:02,800 --> 00:07:05,160
I never expected His Majesty
to favor him so openly.

160
00:07:06,690 --> 00:07:07,560
I knew from the start

161
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:09,360
it wouldn't be easy to bring him down.

162
00:07:10,830 --> 00:07:11,680
It's just a pity

163
00:07:12,310 --> 00:07:14,190
Yuan went to such lengths.

164
00:07:15,430 --> 00:07:16,190
We shouldn't just

165
00:07:16,390 --> 00:07:18,390
let Miss Qi kill him.

166
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:21,190
She's always been good at that.

167
00:07:22,270 --> 00:07:23,870
She's no one's weapon.

168
00:07:24,360 --> 00:07:25,560
I'm not wrong.

169
00:07:25,590 --> 00:07:26,830
Before entering the residence,

170
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,630
she had three lives on her hands.

171
00:07:28,630 --> 00:07:29,270
Shut it.

172
00:07:29,920 --> 00:07:31,390
Three years ago,

173
00:07:31,720 --> 00:07:33,000
you killed one assassin with me

174
00:07:33,000 --> 00:07:34,430
and had nightmares for half a month.

175
00:07:34,800 --> 00:07:36,240
If even we were shaken,

176
00:07:36,800 --> 00:07:37,830
what about her?

177
00:07:38,680 --> 00:07:40,240
No one is born wanting to kill.

178
00:07:41,120 --> 00:07:43,160
That's not what I meant.

179
00:07:44,950 --> 00:07:45,720
She was alone.

180
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:47,920
She killed only to survive.

181
00:07:48,630 --> 00:07:50,070
Besides, she has me now...

182
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:56,430
As an ally, I mean.

183
00:07:57,000 --> 00:07:58,870
How could I let her risk herself again?

184
00:08:08,000 --> 00:08:08,800
Seriously,

185
00:08:08,800 --> 00:08:09,720
Miss Qi?

186
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,680
You can still drink?

187
00:08:14,160 --> 00:08:15,390
Prince Qi has stayed on top

188
00:08:15,510 --> 00:08:17,680
because of wealth, power, and influence.

189
00:08:18,040 --> 00:08:19,630
Now that we've cut off his money,

190
00:08:20,360 --> 00:08:21,680
shouldn't we celebrate?

191
00:08:24,270 --> 00:08:26,240
So you knew this would happen?

192
00:08:26,250 --> 00:08:27,830
Someone was worried you'd be disappointed

193
00:08:28,390 --> 00:08:28,870
and...

194
00:08:39,241 --> 00:08:40,870
Prince Qi's influence runs deep.

195
00:08:41,000 --> 00:08:43,670
We'll dismantle his faction
piece by piece.

196
00:08:43,750 --> 00:08:46,200
The Qi family has cut ties with him.

197
00:08:47,960 --> 00:08:48,750
Though

198
00:08:49,030 --> 00:08:50,670
he escaped this time,

199
00:08:51,200 --> 00:08:52,550
if there's a next time,

200
00:08:52,790 --> 00:08:53,630
do you think

201
00:08:53,910 --> 00:08:56,320
His Majesty will spare him again?

202
00:08:58,320 --> 00:08:59,780
You still have evidence against him?

203
00:09:07,910 --> 00:09:08,550
Nice brew.

204
00:09:09,460 --> 00:09:11,380
(Prince Qi Residence)

205
00:09:19,870 --> 00:09:21,200
How goes the case

206
00:09:21,600 --> 00:09:22,850
at the Court of Judicial Review?

207
00:09:23,540 --> 00:09:25,340
(Prince Cheng)

208
00:09:25,360 --> 00:09:26,900
We've found someone to take the blame.

209
00:09:27,080 --> 00:09:28,960
All the accounts have been cleaned up.

210
00:09:33,080 --> 00:09:34,720
Why couldn't I be the one

211
00:09:34,870 --> 00:09:37,510
to meet such a beautiful thorny rose?

212
00:09:38,630 --> 00:09:40,270
Don't let that ruin you.

213
00:09:42,910 --> 00:09:44,440
Since she failed to finish me off

214
00:09:44,440 --> 00:09:45,720
with the embezzlement case,

215
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,360
she won't stop here.

216
00:09:49,910 --> 00:09:50,840
I'm worried...

217
00:09:50,840 --> 00:09:52,550
However she targets you, I don't care.

218
00:09:52,960 --> 00:09:54,080
I came today

219
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:55,630
to warn you of one thing.

220
00:09:55,910 --> 00:09:57,200
Whatever happens,

221
00:09:57,790 --> 00:09:58,590
don't let her meddle

222
00:09:58,670 --> 00:10:00,550
with Yueying Pleasure House

223
00:10:00,550 --> 00:10:01,510
we run together.

224
00:10:01,550 --> 00:10:03,080
Don't spoil my fun.

225
00:10:14,840 --> 00:10:16,320
Just what kind of place is it

226
00:10:16,840 --> 00:10:18,120
that I have to hide my face?

227
00:10:22,480 --> 00:10:23,120
What?

228
00:10:24,120 --> 00:10:25,270
Does Your Highness

229
00:10:25,750 --> 00:10:27,960
only investigate cases in noble places?

230
00:10:31,270 --> 00:10:33,670
Noble describes people, not places.

231
00:10:37,840 --> 00:10:38,720
Fine, fine.

232
00:10:38,910 --> 00:10:40,240
Noble, then.

233
00:10:41,200 --> 00:10:42,000
Don't forget.

234
00:10:42,010 --> 00:10:43,910
I'm the one who brought in
the Ministry of Justice.

235
00:10:44,510 --> 00:10:45,790
We're allies.

236
00:10:59,790 --> 00:11:04,430
♪How I wish to hold onto
this fleeting warmth♪

237
00:11:04,810 --> 00:11:08,590
♪How I wish to live this life
only for you♪

238
00:11:09,100 --> 00:11:14,560
♪When memories sink
and the heart settles♪

239
00:11:14,780 --> 00:11:18,940
♪Forgetting life, death,
parting, and reunion♪

240
00:11:19,730 --> 00:11:24,010
♪How I wish to stay
only in the moment with you♪

241
00:11:24,810 --> 00:11:31,710
♪Anchoring myself by your side♪
